target-service, with MockMvc:
- No token: 401.
- Valid internal token on an async endpoint: 2xx.
- Valid internal token on a user-only endpoint: 403.
- 401 for each of: wrong aud, expired, bad signature, unknown kid,
  unknown issuer, algorithm other than RS256.
- Valid user token (mock the IdP decoder): 2xx.

